WEBVTT

00:35:59.371 --> 00:36:02.871
I felt that I had to learn more about it.

00:36:03.538 --> 00:36:07.663
So I went I got a bit of
money and got to spend.

00:36:07.663 --> 00:36:11.079
It was six different brain states to
learn about what was happening to

00:36:11.079 --> 00:36:13.413
the chimps. And at the same time,

00:36:13.413 --> 00:36:18.079
I was learning about the plight faced
by so many African people living in

00:36:18.079 --> 00:36:21.954
and around chimp habitat know
the crippling poverty,

00:36:21.954 --> 00:36:23.746
the lack of health and education,

00:36:23.746 --> 00:36:27.454
the degradation of man growing
human populations

00:36:27.954 --> 00:36:32.829
and flying over Gumbley that had been
part of this equatorial forest belt.